{"articleNo":"463756","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=463756&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] 2023년 우주전파재난 예측 AI 경진대회","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.09.20","hit":"3170","attachments":[{"name":"230925_2023 우주전파재난 예측 AI 경진대회 공고문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=463756&attachNo=127742"},{"name":"AI경진대회_이미지확인.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=download&articleNo=463756&attachNo=127743"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">대 회 명 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: 2023</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">년 우주전파재난 예측 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">AI </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">경진대회</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">  </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">주최</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">주관 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">국립전파연구원 우주전파센터</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">주요내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">과거 특정기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(60</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2.8</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">㎓ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">태양활동 수준의 관측데이터를 활용하여</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">향후 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">30</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">일간의 태양활동 수준을 예측하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">AI </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">모델 개발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">참가대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">대한민국 국민 모두</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">개인</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">/</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">), </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">선착순 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">60</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">팀</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">대회기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 2023.9.25.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) ~ 11.13.(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">시상내용 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">과학기술정보통신부 장관상 및 상금 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; ※ </span><span style=\"text-indent: -102.1pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">세부내용은 붙임의 공고문 참조</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%; margin-left: 204.1pt; text-indent: -102.1pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\"> </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%; margin-left: 8em; text-indent: -102.1pt;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 123%; margin-left: 8em; text-indent: -102.1pt;\"><br></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"10764\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"11, 0, 0, 7571\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_10\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2023-09-20T16:52:21.321Z\",\n\"md\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"pd\": \"1601-01-01T09:00:00.000Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do\": {\n\"pa\": 1,\n\"fo\": 1,\n\"en\": 1,\n\"pi\": 1,\n\"tb\": 1,\n\"eq\": 1\n},\n\"fo\": [ ],\n\"cd\": {\n\"tp\": 0,\n\"lc\": {\n\"af\": false,\n\"ui\": false,\n\"fu\": false,\n\"dn\": false,\n\"ul\": false,\n\"el\": false,\n\"at\": false,\n\"tq\": false,\n\"da\": false,\n\"dw\": false,\n\"dj\": false,\n\"bc\": false,\n\"bu\": false,\n\"al\": false,\n\"ab\": false,\n\"ap\": false,\n\"an\": false,\n\"aa\": false,\n\"ds\": false,\n\"de\": false,\n\"as\": false,\n\"cp\": false,\n\"ao\": false,\n\"et\": false,\n\"ay\": false,\n\"am\": false,\n\"a1\": false,\n\"bt\": false,\n\"av\": false,\n\"dh\": false,\n\"dp\": false,\n\"d1\": false,\n\"mf\": false,\n\"bl\": false,\n\"ag\": false,\n\"dg\": false,\n\"ae\": false,\n\"df\": false,\n\"do\": false,\n\"dl\": false,\n\"di\": false,\n\"d2\": false,\n\"d3\": false,\n\"ob\": false,\n\"d4\": false,\n\"ev\": false,\n\"d5\": false,\n\"d6\": false,\n\"a2\": false,\n\"dc\": false\n}\n},\n